                    "text": "SUPER PIEKNA PIOSENKA",
                    "author": "@Gra\u017cynaS-r5p",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T23:03:58Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Pi\u0119kny przekaz ,\u015bliczna piosenka dzi\u0119kuj\u0119 za pami\u0119\u0107 \u2764\u2764\u2764\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a,\u017cycz\u0105c Tobie mi\u0142ego dnia",
                    "author": "@wandakuszel7842",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T19:48:24Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Wdzi\u0119czno\u015b\u0107 bezwarunkowa dla Ciebie Panie",
                    "author": "@CecyliaMatczak",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T20:58:19Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u015aliczna \ud83c\udfbc\ud83c\udf39niech\n\u015bwiat si\u0119 kr\u0119ci my mamy\nw\u0142asny sw\u00f3j obieg \ns\u0142o\u0144ca \ud83c\udf39\u2764\ufe0f\ud83e\udd8b",
                    "author": "@RenataPi\u0119tak-e4r",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T23:11:12Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Dzi\u0119kuj\u0119 za spotkanie w piosence \u2764\u015awiat\u0142o. Pozdrawiam serdecznie",
                    "author": "@CecyliaMatczak",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T20:05:19Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@Miros\u0142awaWyka",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T19:19:52Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\ufe0f\ud83e\udec2",
                    "author": "@DanutaBielenin",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T06:19:04Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@SylwiaKostrzewa-e6i",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-30T04:59:46Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@IrenaB-g6w",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-02T01:30:58Z"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "fetchedAt": "20260413_072955",
            "commentCount": 23,
            "comments": [
                {
                    "text": "Pi\u0119kna piosenka pi\u0119kne s\u0142owa pozdrawiam serdecznie \u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@EwaBenyskiewicz",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T09:15:11Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Witaj \ud83d\ude0api\u0119kna nutka tyle mi\u0142o\u015bci\nTego najpi\u0119kniejszego uczucia\nPi\u0119kne s\u0142owa pi\u0119kne wykonanie\nDzi\u0119kuj\u0119 \u017ce mog\u0142am jej pos\u0142ucha\u0107 \ud83d\ude0a\u270b\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udf39\ud83e\udd8b\nZrozumia\u0142am co to znaczy mie\u0107\nSerce daleko, a jednocze\u015bnie bli\u017cej\nNi\u017c cokolwiek, jeste\u015b \u015bwiat\u0142em\nKt\u00f3re przenika moj\u0105 dusz\u0119 nigdy\nNie ga\u015bnie kocha\u0142am ci\u0119 wczoraj\nKocham ci\u0119 teraz, kocham jurto\nB\u0119d\u0119 kocha\u0107 ka\u017cdego dnia\nSkrycie i otwarcie bo tobie\nOdda\u0142am moje \u017cycie \u2764\u2764\nPa pa \u270b\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udf39\ud83e\udd8b",
                    "author": "@mieciaszymkiewicz4618",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-12T06:43:09Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "No tak deklaracja pi\u0119kna \u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@mariolamaleszka5993",
                    "likes": 3,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T01:05:53Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Dzie\u0144 dobry \u2764dzi\u0119kuj\u0119 za pi\u0119kna piosenke\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@Wadysawa-vy8xi",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T06:42:28Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bezgranicznie i na zawsze \u2764\u2764 SERCE",
                    "author": "@angelikabauk1639",
                    "likes": 3,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T18:28:09Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Pi\u0119kne wyznanie mi\u0142o\u015bci \ud83c\udf39\ud83d\ude18\ud83d\ude18\ud83d\ude18\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\ud83d\udc8b\ud83d\udc8b\ud83d\udc8b\ud83d\udc8b",
                    "author": "@krystynazukowska6839",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T18:23:31Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Cudne wyznanie\u2764\ud83d\ude0a. Pi\u0119kny  wokal.",
                    "author": "@TERESACZENCZEK-b3d",
                    "likes": 3,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T18:05:10Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Pi\u0119kna  Piosenka \u2764\u2764  To  pi\u0119kne  jest  jak  m\u0119\u017cczyzna  wy\u017cmaje  kobiecie  swoje  uczucia.  Jak   pi\u0119kna  jest  prawdziwa  , i  szczera  Mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107.   Mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107  daje  rado\u015b\u0107  i szcz\u0119\u015bcie \u2764\ufe0f\ud83e\udd70\ud83d\ude0a\u2764\ufe0f",
                    "author": "@MagdaKulesza-u4w",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-01T05:56:56Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Piekna\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@JoannaGadek-zw1ih",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-01T07:53:44Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "M\u00f3j teraz nasta\u0142",
                    "author": "@CecyliaMatczak",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T20:57:41Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\ud83c\udf3aKOCHAM CI\u0118, M\u00d3J SKARBIE NAJDRO\u017bSZY,\nBEZGRANICZNIE.\nNIE MARTW SI\u0118,\nKOCHANIE, B\u0118DZIE DOBRZE.\nB\u0118DZIEMY DZIELI\u0106 KA\u017bDY PORANEK ZE SOB\u0104 I NIGDY SI\u0118 \nNIE ROZSTANIEMY.\nJESTE\u015a M\u00d3J NA ZAWSZE, A JA,\nJESTEM TYLKO TWOJA. \u017bADNA SI\u0141A NAS NIE ROZDZIELI. B\u0104D\u0179 ZDROWY I SZCZ\u0118\u015aLIWY, MOJE S\u0141ONECZKO \u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf39\ud83c\udf3a\u2764\ufe0f\u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3a\u2764\ufe0f\u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3a\u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3a\u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3a",
                    "author": "@KasiaP-w5z",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T14:19:10Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\u2764\u2764 kri\u015bsssssssss \u2764m\u0105dre s\u0142owa kluczowe w naszym \u017cyciu dzi\u0119kuj\u0119 \u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udcaa\ud83d\udcaa\ud83d\udcaa",
                    "author": "@RobertPerz-d3y",
                    "likes": 5,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T17:12:10Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "No tak pi\u0119kna deklaracja ch\u0142opaka dziewczyna zgodzi si\u0119 na takie zapewnienie b\u0105d\u017acie szcz\u0119\u015bliwi \u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@ZofiaWrzesi\u0144ska-t6j",
                    "likes": 7,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T17:36:44Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "B\u0105d\u017a zawsze przy mnie \u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764pi\u0119kne s\u0142owa,mi\u0142o s\u0142ucha\u0107 \u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@beatapika2791",
                    "likes": 3,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T19:50:52Z"
                },
                {
